      "message": "fix(ui): the refusal ghost's overlay-budget warning goes through diag_warn!\n\nrefusal_ghost.rs printed with eprintln!, which a browser build drops and\nthe diag-seam law (diag::tests::shared_ui_code_prints_only_through_the_diag_seam)\nrefuses. Same message, through the diag seam.\n\nFixes #907\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
